Z||000000||jlhuber||11-02-2000||01:34 PM||||Hey, I don't know if anyone has seen or mentioned this before.  For those wanting a turbo on their fiero, check out these pics-&gt; <A HREF="http://wwnet.fi/amworks/galleria/fiero2.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://wwnet.fi/amworks/galleria/fiero2.htm</A>  It looks to me like they are using a liquid/air I/C, like what the Syclone has on it, near the intake instead of a air/air I/C wich would be tough in the fiero.  here are some more pics too-&gt; <A HREF="http://wwnet.fi/amworks/galleria/amwfiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://wwnet.fi/amworks/galleria/amwfiero.htm</A>  go here for the english version-&gt; <A HREF="http://wwnet.fi/amworks/mainpage.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://wwnet.fi/amworks/mainpage.htm</A>   Just a thought for a turbo.  thanx for the space.  <P><p>[This message has been edited by jlhuber (edited 11-02-2000).]||||reg||3
